---
import CalculatorLayout from '../../layouts/CalculatorLayout.astro';
---

<CalculatorLayout
  title="Pregnancy Calculator – Due Date, Week by Week & Trimester Calculator"
  description="Calculate your pregnancy due date using LMP or conception date. Find your current pregnancy week, trimester, and key milestones with our free online pregnancy calculator."
  category="Health"
  calculatorName="Pregnancy Calculator"
  slug="pregnancy-calculator"
  keywords={[
    'pregnancy calculator',
    'due date calculator',
    'pregnancy due date calculator',
    'pregnancy week calculator',
    'how many weeks pregnant calculator',
    'pregnancy calendar calculator',
    'conception date calculator',
    'trimester calculator',
    'lmp due date calculator'
  ]}
>
  <div class="space-y-6">

    <!-- MODE TABS -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-2.5 shadow-2xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto pb-1 text-xs font-semibold scrollbar-thin">
        <button type="button" class="btn-preg-tab active shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-pink-600 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-bold text-white shadow-xs cursor-pointer" data-tab="lmp">By Last Period (LMP)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-preg-tab shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-tab="conception">By Conception Date</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-preg-tab shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-tab="duedate">By Due Date (Reverse)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-preg-tab shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-tab="ivf">IVF / Transfer Date 🔬</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PRESETS -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-3.5 shadow-2xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mr-1 flex items-center gap-1"><span>⚡</span> Quick Fill:</span>
        <button type="button" id="btn-today" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-pink-500 hover:text-pink-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer">📅 Set LMP as Today</button>
        <button type="button" id="btn-2weeks" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-pink-500 hover:text-pink-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer">📅 LMP = 2 Weeks Ago</button>
        <button type="button" id="btn-4weeks" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-pink-500 hover:text-pink-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer">📅 LMP = 4 Weeks Ago</button>
        <button type="button" id="btn-8weeks" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-pink-500 hover:text-pink-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer">📅 LMP = 8 Weeks Ago</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MAIN PANEL -->
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-linear-to-br from-white via-pink-50/20 to-rose-50/30 p-5 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-950 dark:to-pink-950/10 sm:p-7">

      <!-- LMP PANEL -->
      <div id="panel-lmp" class="preg-panel space-y-5">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2"><span>🤰</span> Pregnancy Due Date Calculator (from LMP)</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Enter the first day of your last menstrual period (LMP). Using Naegele's Rule: Due Date = LMP + 280 days (40 weeks).</p>
        </div>
        <form id="form-preg-lmp" class="space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div><label for="lmp-date" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">First Day of Last Menstrual Period (LMP)</label><input type="date" id="lmp-date" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
            <div><label for="cycle-length" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Average Cycle Length (Days)</label>
              <select id="cycle-length" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">
                <option value="21">21 days</option><option value="22">22 days</option><option value="23">23 days</option><option value="24">24 days</option><option value="25">25 days</option><option value="26">26 days</option><option value="27">27 days</option><option value="28" selected>28 days (Average)</option><option value="29">29 days</option><option value="30">30 days</option><option value="31">31 days</option><option value="32">32 days</option><option value="33">33 days</option><option value="34">34 days</option><option value="35">35 days</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-2">
            <button type="submit" id="btn-lmp-calc" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-pink-600/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">Calculate Due Date →</button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-lmp-clear" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">Clear (✕)</button>
          </div>
          <p id="err-preg" class="hidden rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-red-700 dark:border-red-900/60 dark:bg-red-950/30 dark:text-red-300"></p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- CONCEPTION PANEL -->
      <div id="panel-conception" class="preg-panel hidden space-y-5">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2"><span>🗓️</span> Due Date Calculator from Conception Date</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">If you know your exact conception or ovulation date, enter it below. Due date = Conception Date + 266 days.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="form-preg-conception" class="space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
          <div><label for="conception-date" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Conception / Ovulation Date</label><input type="date" id="conception-date" class="mt-1.5 w-full sm:w-64 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button type="submit" id="btn-con-calc" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-pink-600/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">Calculate from Conception →</button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-con-clear" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">Clear (✕)</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- DUE DATE PANEL -->
      <div id="panel-duedate" class="preg-panel hidden space-y-5">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2"><span>🔄</span> Reverse: Calculate LMP from Due Date</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Know your due date? Calculate your LMP, conception date, and current pregnancy week.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="form-preg-dd" class="space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
          <div><label for="due-date" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Estimated Due Date</label><input type="date" id="due-date" class="mt-1.5 w-full sm:w-64 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button type="submit" id="btn-dd-calc" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-pink-600/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">Calculate from Due Date →</button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-dd-clear" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">Clear (✕)</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- IVF PANEL -->
      <div id="panel-ivf" class="preg-panel hidden space-y-5">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2"><span>🔬</span> IVF Due Date Calculator</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Calculate your IVF due date based on embryo transfer date. Day-3 embryo transfer adds 263 days; Day-5 adds 261 days.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="form-preg-ivf" class="space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div><label for="ivf-date" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Embryo Transfer Date</label><input type="date" id="ivf-date" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
            <div><label for="ivf-day" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Embryo Day (at Transfer)</label>
              <select id="ivf-day" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-semibold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">
                <option value="3">Day 3 Embryo Transfer</option>
                <option value="5" selected>Day 5 Blastocyst Transfer</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button type="submit" id="btn-ivf-calc" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-pink-600/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">Calculate IVF Due Date →</button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-ivf-clear" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">Clear (✕)</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- RESULTS -->
      <div id="preg-results" class="hidden mt-6 space-y-5">
        <!-- Hero Card -->
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-pink-200 bg-linear-to-br from-white via-pink-50/40 to-rose-100/50 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-pink-500/5 dark:border-pink-900/60 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-pink-950/30 sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 border-b border-pink-200/80 pb-4 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-700 dark:text-pink-300">🤰 Estimated Due Date</span>
              <div id="preg-res-duedate" class="mt-1 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400">15 Jun 2025</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sm:text-right">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Currently Pregnant:</span>
              <div id="preg-res-weeks" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">12 Weeks 3 Days</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-pink-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">Trimester</div>
              <div id="preg-res-trimester" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400">1st Trimester</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-pink-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">LMP Date</div>
              <div id="preg-res-lmp" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">10 Sep 2024</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-pink-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">Conception Date</div>
              <div id="preg-res-conception" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">24 Sep 2024</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-pink-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">Days Remaining</div>
              <div id="preg-res-remaining" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">195 Days</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pregnancy Progress Bar -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5"><span>📊</span> Pregnancy Progress</h3>
          <div class="mb-2 flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">
            <span>Week 0</span><span id="preg-progress-label">Week 12</span><span>Week 40</span>
          </div>
          <div class="h-4 rounded-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 overflow-hidden">
            <div id="preg-progress-bar" class="h-full rounded-full bg-linear-to-r from-pink-400 to-rose-500 transition-all duration-500" style="width: 30%"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-xs text-center">
            <div id="t1-badge" class="rounded-xl p-2 bg-pink-100 dark:bg-pink-950/40 border border-pink-200 dark:border-pink-900/40 font-bold text-pink-700 dark:text-pink-300">1st Trimester<br/><span class="font-normal text-slate-500">Weeks 1–13</span></div>
            <div id="t2-badge" class="rounded-xl p-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 font-bold text-slate-500">2nd Trimester<br/><span class="font-normal text-slate-400">Weeks 14–27</span></div>
            <div id="t3-badge" class="rounded-xl p-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 font-bold text-slate-500">3rd Trimester<br/><span class="font-normal text-slate-400">Weeks 28–40</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Milestones -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-3 flex items-center gap-1.5"><span>📅</span> Key Pregnancy Milestones</h3>
          <div id="milestones-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SEO CONTENT -->
  <Fragment slot="content">
    <section class="preg-content">
      <h2>Pregnancy Calculator – Due Date, Week by Week & Trimester Guide</h2>
      <p>Our <strong>Pregnancy Calculator</strong> is a comprehensive tool that helps expecting mothers calculate their <strong>estimated due date (EDD)</strong>, determine the current pregnancy week and trimester, track important milestones, and understand their complete pregnancy timeline. Whether you are calculating by your <strong>last menstrual period (LMP)</strong>, conception date, or known due date, our calculator gives you instant and accurate results.</p>

      <h2>What Is a Pregnancy Due Date Calculator?</h2>
      <p>A <strong>pregnancy due date calculator</strong> uses your last menstrual period (LMP) or conception date to estimate when your baby will arrive. The standard calculation follows <strong>Naegele's Rule</strong>: add 280 days (40 weeks) to the first day of your LMP. This works for average 28-day menstrual cycles. For shorter or longer cycles, the calculator automatically adjusts the due date accordingly.</p>

      <h2>How to Calculate Your Due Date (Naegele's Rule)</h2>
      <div class="my-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100/80 p-4 font-mono text-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
        <div>Due Date = LMP + 280 days (40 weeks)</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Or: LMP + 9 months + 7 days (Naegele's Rule shortcut)</div>
      </div>
      <p>For conception date calculation: <strong>Due Date = Conception Date + 266 days</strong> (38 weeks from fertilization).</p>

      <h2>Pregnancy Trimesters Explained</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>First Trimester (Weeks 1–13):</strong> Baby's major organs and systems form. Symptoms: morning sickness, fatigue, breast tenderness. First prenatal visit and ultrasound.</li>
        <li><strong>Second Trimester (Weeks 14–27):</strong> Baby grows rapidly. You will feel the baby move (quickening around 18–22 weeks). Anatomy scan ultrasound. Most women feel better.</li>
        <li><strong>Third Trimester (Weeks 28–40):</strong> Baby gains weight and prepares for birth. Symptoms: Braxton Hicks contractions, back pain, frequent urination. Hospital bag preparation!</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Key Pregnancy Milestones Week by Week</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Week 6:</strong> Heartbeat detectable via ultrasound (around 90–110 bpm)</li>
        <li><strong>Week 8–10:</strong> First prenatal appointment and blood tests</li>
        <li><strong>Week 12:</strong> End of first trimester; nuchal translucency scan</li>
        <li><strong>Week 16–20:</strong> Anatomy ultrasound; gender reveal possible</li>
        <li><strong>Week 20:</strong> Halfway point — 20 weeks down, 20 to go!</li>
        <li><strong>Week 24–28:</strong> Glucose screening test for gestational diabetes</li>
        <li><strong>Week 37:</strong> Baby is considered "full term"</li>
        <li><strong>Week 40:</strong> Estimated due date (only ~5% of babies born exactly on EDD)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>IVF Due Date Calculation</h2>
      <p>For IVF pregnancies, the due date is calculated differently based on the embryo's age at transfer:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Day 3 Embryo Transfer:</strong> Due Date = Transfer Date + 263 days (LMP equivalent = Transfer Date − 17 days)</li>
        <li><strong>Day 5 Blastocyst Transfer:</strong> Due Date = Transfer Date + 261 days (LMP equivalent = Transfer Date − 19 days)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>When Should You See a Doctor?</h2>
      <p>Your first prenatal appointment is typically scheduled between weeks 8–12. Contact your healthcare provider immediately if you experience: heavy bleeding, severe abdominal pain, no fetal movement after week 28, signs of preeclampsia (severe headache, vision changes, swelling), or any other concerning symptoms. Regular prenatal care significantly improves outcomes for both mother and baby.</p>
    </section>
  </Fragment>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <Fragment slot="faq">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800" open>
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. How accurate is a pregnancy due date calculator?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Pregnancy due date calculators are approximately 80% accurate within a 2-week window. Only about 5% of babies are born on their exact due date. The EDD is an estimate — most births occur between weeks 38–42.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. What is the first day of my last menstrual period (LMP)?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">The LMP is the first day of your last period — the day bleeding began, not when it ended. This is the standard starting point for pregnancy dating, even though conception happens about 2 weeks later.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. How many weeks pregnant am I?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Enter your LMP date in our calculator and it will tell you exactly how many weeks and days pregnant you are today. Pregnancy is typically 40 weeks from the LMP, or about 38 weeks from conception.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. When does each trimester start and end?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">First trimester: Weeks 1–13. Second trimester: Weeks 14–27. Third trimester: Weeks 28–40. The second trimester is often the most comfortable period of pregnancy.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. How is the IVF due date calculated differently?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">For Day 5 blastocyst transfer: Due Date = Transfer Date + 261 days. For Day 3 embryo: Add 263 days. Our IVF calculator automatically adjusts for the embryo age at transfer.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">6. What if my cycle is not 28 days?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Our calculator adjusts for different cycle lengths. If your cycle is shorter than 28 days, ovulation happens earlier, shifting the due date earlier. For cycles longer than 28 days, ovulation is later, shifting the due date later.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">7. What is a full-term pregnancy?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Full-term pregnancy is defined as 39–40 weeks. "Early term" is 37–38 weeks, "full term" is 39–40 weeks, "late term" is 41 weeks, and "post-term" is 42+ weeks. Babies born before 37 weeks are considered premature.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</CalculatorLayout>

